{"text":"kuruntokai","n":13,"lines":["மாசறக் கழீஇய யானை போலப்","பெரும்பெயல் உழந்த இரும்பிணர்த் துறுகற்","பைதல் ஒருதலைச் சேக்கும் நாடன்","நோய்தந் தனனே தோழி","பயலை ஆர்ந்தன குவளையங் கண்ணே"],"tr":["mācaṟak kaḻīiya yāṉai pōlap","perumpeyal uḻanta irumpiṇart tuṟukaṟ","paital orutalaic cēkkum nāṭaṉ","nōytan taṉaṉē tōḻi","payalai ārntaṉa kuvaḷaiyaṅ kaṇṇē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கபிலர்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kapilar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 8"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மாசறக்","tr":"mācaṟak","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சறக்","tr":"caṟak"}]},{"text":"கழீஇய","tr":"kaḻīiya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கழீ","tr":"kaḻī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இய","tr":"iya"}]},{"text":"யானை","tr":"yāṉai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"}]},{"text":"போலப்","tr":"pōlap","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லப்","tr":"lap"}]}],[{"text":"பெரும்பெயல்","tr":"perumpeyal","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரும்","tr":"perum"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெயல்","tr":"peyal"}]},{"text":"உழந்த","tr":"uḻanta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உழந்","tr":"uḻan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"இரும்பிணர்த்","tr":"irumpiṇart","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இரும்","tr":"irum"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிணர்த்","tr":"piṇart"}]},{"text":"துறுகற்","tr":"tuṟukaṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறு","tr":"tuṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கற்","tr":"kaṟ"}]}],[{"text":"பைதல்","tr":"paital","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பை","tr":"pai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தல்","tr":"tal"}]},{"text":"ஒருதலைச்","tr":"orutalaic","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஒரு","tr":"oru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலைச்","tr":"talaic"}]},{"text":"சேக்கும்","tr":"cēkkum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சேக்","tr":"cēk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]},{"text":"நாடன்","tr":"nāṭaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டன்","tr":"ṭaṉ"}]}],[{"text":"நோய்தந்","tr":"nōytan","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோய்","tr":"nōy"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தந்","tr":"tan"}]},{"text":"தனனே","tr":"taṉaṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]}],[{"text":"பயலை","tr":"payalai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பய","tr":"paya"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"ஆர்ந்தன","tr":"ārntaṉa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆர்ந்","tr":"ārn"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"}]},{"text":"குவளையங்","tr":"kuvaḷaiyaṅ","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குவ","tr":"kuva"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளை","tr":"ḷai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யங்","tr":"yaṅ"}]},{"text":"கண்ணே","tr":"kaṇṇē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணே","tr":"ṇē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"மாசு","parts":[{"text":"மாசு","lemma":"மாசு","gloss":"dirt"}],"gloss":"dirt"},{"surface":"அற","parts":[{"text":"அறு","lemma":"அறு","gloss":"to cease"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitival suffix"}],"gloss":"to be removed completely"},{"surface":"கழீஇய","parts":[{"text":"கழீஇய","lemma":"கழீஇய","gloss":"washed"}],"gloss":"washed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல்","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"resemble"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitival suffix"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெரும்பெயல்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"greatness"},{"text":"பெயல்","lemma":"பெயல்","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"heavy rain"},{"surface":"உழந்த","parts":[{"text":"உழந்த","lemma":"உழந்த","gloss":"that endured"}],"gloss":"that endured","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இரும்பிணர்த்","parts":[{"text":"இரும்பிணர்த்","lemma":"இரும்பிணர்த்","gloss":"dark and rough"}],"gloss":"dark and rough","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துறுகல்","parts":[{"text":"துறுகல்","lemma":"துறுகல்","gloss":"boulder"}],"gloss":"boulder"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பைதல்","parts":[{"text":"பைதல்","lemma":"பைதல்","gloss":"green moss"}],"gloss":"green moss"},{"surface":"ஒருதலைச்","parts":[{"text":"ஒருதலைச்","lemma":"ஒருதலைச்","gloss":"on one side"}],"gloss":"on one side","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சேக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"சே","lemma":"சே","gloss":"rest"},{"text":"க்கும்","lemma":"க்கும்","gloss":"habitual future suffix"}],"gloss":"where it rests"},{"surface":"நாடன்","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"he-of"}],"gloss":"lord of the land"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நோய்","parts":[{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"நோய்","gloss":"affliction"}],"gloss":"affliction"},{"surface":"தந்தனனே","parts":[{"text":"தந்தனனே","lemma":"தந்தனனே","gloss":"he gave indeed"}],"gloss":"he gave indeed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend!"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பயலை","parts":[{"text":"பயலை","lemma":"பயலை","gloss":"pallor"}],"gloss":"pallor"},{"surface":"ஆர்ந்தன","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்ந்தன","lemma":"ஆர்ந்தன","gloss":"became filled"}],"gloss":"became filled","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குவளையங்","parts":[{"text":"குவளையங்","lemma":"குவளையங்","gloss":"beautiful blue-lily-like"}],"gloss":"beautiful blue-lily-like","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic"}],"gloss":"eyes indeed"}]}],"literal":"Like an elephant washed so that dirt is removed, / on the dark, rough boulder that endured heavy rain, / the lord of the land where green moss rests on one side / gave me this affliction, O friend! / Pallor has filled my beautiful blue-lily-like eyes.","translation":"Like an elephant washed clean of all dirt, a dark, rough boulder has weathered the heavy rain, and green moss now clings to one side of it. The lord of the land where such boulders lie has brought this painful affliction upon me, my friend, and my eyes, once like beautiful blue water-lilies, are now filled with the pale yellow of grief.","modern":"தோழியே! அழுக்கு நீங்குமாறு கழுவப்பட்ட யானையைப் போல, பெருமழையைத் தாங்கிய கரிய சொரசொரப்பான பாறையின் ஒரு பக்கத்தில் பசுமையான பாசி படர்ந்திருக்கும் மலைநாட்டைச் சேர்ந்த தலைவன் எனக்குத் துன்பத்தைத் தந்துவிட்டான். அதனால், குவளை மலர் போன்ற என் கண்கள் பசலை நிறம் அடைந்துவிட்டன.","explanation":"In this Kuriñci poem, the heroine is speaking to her close friend about her distress during the hero's absence. She describes the hero's mountainous land, where heavy rains wash the dark, rough boulders until they resemble clean elephants, leaving green moss to grow on one side. This vivid natural image serves as an ulluṟai (implied metaphor): just as the dark boulder is weathered by the rain and gets covered in moss, the heroine's dark, beautiful eyes have weathered the rain of her tears and are now covered by the pale yellow-green tint of payalai (pallor of separation). The key words are 'tuṟukal' (boulder), 'paital' (green moss/distress), 'nōy' (affliction), and 'payalai' (pallor). Through this comparison, she conveys how the hero's absence has physically transformed her beauty into a state of grief.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.3],[1.3,1.8],[1.8,2.82],[2.82,3.5],[3.5,4.1],[4.1,4.5],[4.5,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,6.8],[6.8,8.55],[8.55,9.0],[9.0,9.43],[9.43,10.07],[10.07,11.03],[11.03,12.0],[12.0,12.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.2],[1.2,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,2.88],[2.88,3.6],[3.6,4.3],[4.5,4.9],[4.9,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,6.9],[6.9,7.2],[7.2,8.29],[8.29,9.1],[9.1,9.9],[9.9,10.46],[10.46,11.4],[11.4,12.3],[12.3,12.7]]},"sync":[[["மாசு","dirt"],["அற","to be removed completely"]],[["கழீஇய","washed"]],[["யானை","elephant"]],[["போல","like"]],[["பெரும்பெயல்","heavy rain"]],[["உழந்த","that endured"]],[["இரும்பிணர்த்","dark and rough"]],[["துறுகல்","boulder"]],[["பைதல்","green moss"]],[["ஒருதலைச்","on one side"]],[["சேக்கும்","where it rests"]],[["நாடன்","lord of the land"]],[["நோய்","affliction"],["தந்தனனே","he gave indeed"]],[["தந்தனனே","he gave indeed"]],[["தோழி","O friend!"]],[["பயலை","pallor"]],[["ஆர்ந்தன","became filled"]],[["குவளையங்","beautiful blue-lily-like"]],[["கண்ணே","eyes indeed"]]]}